## Build-context excludes for every image built from the repo root
## (infra/docker/service.Dockerfile, infra/docker/dev.Dockerfile).
## Dependencies are installed and dist/ built inside the containers, so host
## artifacts (macOS-native node_modules especially) must never leak in.

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/out
**/release
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets — env files stay on the host; the example files are documentation.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local
**/.dev.vars

# Generated SDKs, framework caches, misc
/sdk
**/.astro
**/.wrangler
**/.next
src-tauri/target
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.DS_Store
.reviews
.claude/worktrees
